# Merge to main

When implementation on a feature branch is complete and tests pass:

- Merge into `main` locally. Do not present merge / PR / keep / discard options.
- Do not ask whether to merge.
- Do not push unless the user asks.
- After a successful merge and passing tests, delete the feature branch.
